<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 17.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 17.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				March 17	     March 14</p>
<p>Fed acct			10.386		  5.050</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  18.731		  7.737</p>
<p>Cash balance		  29.117		 12.787</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,  subject to limit	5,276.246</p>
<p>	    5,275.342</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $3 million were issued and $106 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
